~ start
Level Design Elder: [[Hi|Hello|Greetings]], StoryWeaver. Welcome to the wondrous world of level design!
Level Design Elder: If you've made it this far, I expect you have some imagination you are itching to put to use.
Level Design Elder: These quests will show you some of the building blocks for creating your own level.
do balloon.hide()
do show_storybook()
if chosen_quest == null:
	% Level Design Elder: Very well, these will always be here when you need them.
	% Level Design Elder: Good luck exploring the rest of the archipelago!
else:
	% Level Design Elder: Excellent! Before you start messing about with mechanics, it's important to have a well designed area for your adventure to take place.
	% Level Design Elder: Please let me know when you've put this to good use, I love seeing it work!
	% Level Design Elder: Some of Threadbare's finest quests use this!
=> END
